Error [E0376]: C-style counter loop headers are retired
  --> tests/ui/loop_counter_form_retired.jet:2:25
    |
  2 |     loop i := 0, i < 5, i += 1 {
    |                         ^
 Why: a three-slot loop header is binding, source, and step rule — not init, condition, and assignment
 Fix: write `loop i, 0..<n { … }` or `loop i, 0..n, 2 { … }`; keep `loop name := value, condition { … }` for mutable state
